		{"id":"f9e18fb086cdc545","type":"text","text":"# Startup Ecosystem Briefing — Bangalore, Chennai, Hyderabad (April 23, 2026)\n\n> The startup ecosystem in Bangalore, Chennai, and Hyderabad is actively evolving with notable funding rounds and government support for AI and enterprise automation startups [69 Best Startups in Bangalore to Watch in 2026 - Seedtable](https://www.seedtable.com/best-startups-in-bangalore).\n\n## Startup News — Bangalore\n\n> No strong results found for this domain.\n\n## Startup News — Chennai\n\n| Name          | What                                           | Amount / Size      | Deadline | Action |\n|---------------|------------------------------------------------|---------------------|----------|--------|\n| Rocketlane    | Automation platform raised Series C funding    | ₹4980 Cr (approx.)  |          | [Visit →](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/deccan-founders_rocketlane-aiautomation-funding-activity-7442604207259598848-4E9M) |\n| GrowXCD Finance | Financial services startup with significant funding | ₹250 Cr            |          | [Visit →](https://www.failory.com/startups/chennai) |\n\n## Startup News — Hyderabad\n\n| Name                | What                                           | Amount / Size      | Deadline | Action |\n|---------------------|------------------------------------------------|---------------------|----------|--------|\n| Cheerio AI          | AI-powered customer engagement platform        | ₹8 Cr               |          | [Visit →](https://startuptalky.com/news/daily-indian-startup-funding-roundup-key-news-5-march-2026/) |\n| Workroom Automation  | Connected factory platform raised seed funding | ₹62 Lakh            |          | [Visit →](https://www.electronicsforyou.biz/industry-buzz/factory-intelligence-startup-workroom-automation-raises-%E2%82%B962-million/) |\n| Deccan AI           | Automation solutions company raised Series A funding | ₹2075 Cr (approx.) |          | [Visit →](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/yourstory-com_fundingalert-saas-startupindia-activity-7442835212054687745-87qs) |\n\n## Government Schemes — Karnataka\n\n| Name               | What                                           | Amount / Size      | Deadline        | Action |\n|--------------------|------------------------------------------------|---------------------|------------------|--------|\n| ELEVATE NXT 2026   | Deeptech grant-in-aid program                 | Up to ₹1 Cr         | February 17, 2026 | [Visit →](https://www.missionstartupkarnataka.org/elevate-karnataka) |\n\n## Government Schemes — Tamil Nadu\n\n| Name               | What                                           | Amount / Size      | Deadline | Action |\n|--------------------|------------------------------------------------|---------------------|----------|--------|\n| StartupTN          | Government initiative for startup support      | ₹10-30 Lakhs        |          | [Visit →](https://www.startupgrantsindia.com/state/tamil-nadu) |\n| TANSIDCO Startup Fund | Financial support for startups               | ₹10-30 Lakhs        |          | [Visit →](https://www.startupgrantsindia.com/state/tamil-nadu) |\n| TANSEED Program    | Seed funding for startups                      | ₹10-30 Lakhs        |          | [Visit →](https://www.startupgrantsindia.com/state/tamil-nadu) |\n\n## Government Schemes — Telangana\n\n| Name                               | What                                           | Amount / Size      | Deadline | Action |\n|------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|---------------------|----------|--------|\n| T-Spark Initiative                 | Funding program for startups                   | Grants for 155 startups |          | [Visit →](https://startup.telangana.gov.in/funding-incentives/) |\n| Fund of Funds for AI-driven Startups | Boosting AI-driven healthcare and life sciences startups | ₹20 billion       |          | [Visit →](https://startupgenome.com/ecosystems/telangana) |\n| T-Fund                             | Funding initiative managed by T-Hub           |                     |          | [Visit →](https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/startup-schemes-india-2026-guide-funding-opportunities-arthayan-0epgf) |\n\n## Investment Funds — Bangalore\n\n> No strong results found for this domain.\n\n## Investment Funds — Chennai\n\n> No strong results found for this domain.\n\n## Incubation & Acceleration — Bangalore\n\n| Name                               | What                                           | Amount / Size      | Deadline | Action |\n|------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|---------------------|----------|--------|\n| Google for Startups Accelerator: India | Equity-free program for AI startups         | Equity-free         | Applications open for 2026 cohort | [Visit →](https://www.bweducation.com/article/applications-open-for-ai-startup-accelerator-in-india-600186) |\n| NSRCEL                             | Incubator supporting founders                  |                     |          | [Visit →](https://zeroado.com/blog/startup-incubators-and-accelerators-in-bangalore) |\n| Social Alpha                       | Incubator providing funding and mentorship     |                     |          | [Visit →](https://www.failory.com/startups/bangalore-accelerators-incubators) |","x":440,"y":1320,"width":980,"height":1960},
		{"id":"b937e9de2b796378","type":"text","text":"```json\n[{\"answer\":\"I would like start a new service line which will provide lab report of ornament. It provides the purity, purity consistency across the structure, 3D model of the ornament for future reference - this may be used while going for the bank loans (to check before and after condition), yearly audit, temple asset inventory validation, individuals with multiple assets.  I will be obtaining the XRF machine, build additional software on top of it for other reports like structure etc.,\",\"question\":\"What are you building?\"},{\"answer\":\"deeptech\",\"question\":\"Which space are you in?\"},{\"answer\":\"just-idea\",\"question\":\"Where are you right now?\"},{\"answer\":\"Bangalore\",\"question\":\"Where are you based?\"}]\n```","x":1480,"y":1320,"width":520,"height":580}
